  <data name="Text_ChannelWarningContent" xml:space="preserve"><value>Automatic is recommended. This method uses private Intel driver settings and restarts the selected Wi-Fi adapter. Channel 6 was verified on Intel AX200 driver 24.0.2.1. Other adapters, drivers and channels are unverified: they may ignore the request or fail to start. You may try anyway. The app checks the reported channel and attempts to restore previous settings on failure. A matching readback does not prove the driver honored the request if Automatic would choose the same channel.</value></data>
